ROUTINE RLMAudit
 ; Optional AI Hub deliverable #1: a recursive-language-model (RLM) data-quality
 ; audit over all 74,998 sources in GaiaQualityStats, written to
 ; data/out/rlm_audit.md.
 ;
 ; Kept out of ^RunScript on purpose, exactly like ^Analyze: it makes LLM calls,
 ; so its wall-clock is not ours to control, and ^RunScript is the benchmarked
 ; entry point. Requires OPENAI_API_KEY in the container environment; without it
 ; the report says so and result.csv is untouched.
 ;
 ; Run ^RunScript first - the RLM slices GaiaQualityStats and its two
 ; materialized prediction columns, which that pipeline produces.
 New outDir,report
 Set outDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/out"
 Do ##class(%File).CreateDirectoryChain(outDir)
 Write "Running Gaia.RLM audit (recursive, depth<=",##class(Gaia.RLM).#MAXDEPTH,", <=",##class(Gaia.RLM).#MAXCALLS," LLM calls)...",!
 Set report = ##class(Gaia.RLM).Audit(outDir_"/rlm_audit.md")
 Write "Audit: ",outDir,"/rlm_audit.md (",$Length(report)," chars)",!
 Quit
